ings as maybe less important than  they actually are so this I think will  help the cause of preserve and not only  these eight buildings and the rest of  Frank Lloyd Wright's work but a lot of  other buildings that are part of our  modern cultural heritage simply gorgeous  yeah I live there modern and just he was  so ahead of his time oh go on with your  bad self  Frank Lloyd Wright
 

